I go to my old room.
My things are there.
The new flat is very close.
First, I take two small bags.
I walk to the new flat.
I put them in the living room.
They are now on the floor.
The bags lie next to the sofa.
I go back to the old room.
There is a big suitcase there.
It is very heavy.
I pull the suitcase slowly to the new flat.
I put it in the bedroom.
The big suitcase sits near the bed.
All my things are now in the new flat.
